5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know what the changeover actually costs us in time. Who else is checking the morning routine upstairs?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am checking the department's floor billing basis. We need to understand the monthly cost before committing to any layout.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I am looking into the drawn plan against the staff survey. We need to see if the proposed layout actually addresses the complaints people have already voiced.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I am checking the sound meter readings across the room. Comfort is invisible on paper, but noise is not.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I’m checking what this year’s two joiners reported. I want to see how sitting next to people actually changes what we learn from each other.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, does the billing basis cover the cost of moving desks, or just the space we occupy?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"It covers the space we occupy, not the moving. But knowing the monthly baseline is essential before we spend more.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, the survey shows daylight is the top complaint. The current plan leaves three desks in the dark.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, daylight is nice, but I care about the noise floor. Are you checking the sound levels near the printer?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, I’m focusing on the people side. How does the noise level affect how much we actually talk to each other?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, if daylight is the top complaint, does the new plan actually fix it, or are we just moving the problem?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the billing basis is static. It doesn’t account for the disruption of moving, only the space we occupy.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, the plan only gives four desks windows. Three remain against the interior wall. We need to decide who accepts that trade-off.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Yumi, noise doesn’t just annoy; it blocks the quiet focus I need. If the printer row is loud, I’m not sitting there.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, loud noise might block focus, but it also blocks the casual chats where I actually learn the team’s unwritten rules.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, if three desks stay in the dark, who decides who sits there? I need to know if that choice is random or deliberate.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the billing basis is fixed. It doesn’t account for disruption, only the space we occupy.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, it is deliberate. I am checking the unplanned shuffles to see if we can avoid repeating past mistakes.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, the choice is deliberate, but I need the sound data to justify my position. I am checking the unplanned shuffles to see if we can avoid repeating past mistakes.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, I’m checking the unplanned shuffles too. I want to see if those interruptions actually hurt how we connect with each other.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
