35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, the upstairs timing shows four to nine minutes just to settle in. That eats my gaps.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, that is time, not money. I found the billing basis: we pay for area, not heads. Two empty desks cost 41,000 yen monthly.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
