39,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"- **Mizuki**: @Rin, four to nine minutes daily is significant. I found the survey confirms daylight is the top complaint, and the plan leaves three desks in the dark.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
