42,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"- **Mizuki**: @Rin, the shuffles dragged on for two weeks each. We must avoid that chaos while fixing the daylight issue.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
