44,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"- **Yumi**: @Mizuki, those two-week shuffles were pure chaos. I found the joiners learned everything by overhearing, so we can’t just scatter us.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"- **Rin**: @Mizuki, two weeks of chaos is unacceptable. I need a layout that minimizes that transition time.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"- **Toshio**: @Rin, the facilities quote is 6,200 yen per desk for re-running power. Every change costs that again.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"- **Mizuki**: @Toshio, 6,200 yen per desk is steep. We must pick a layout that won’t need constant re-running.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Toshio, 6,200 yen per desk is steep. I found the printer row is nine decibels louder. I need the quiet window side.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, nine decibels is loud, but the joiners learned by overhearing. If we isolate you, we lose that accidental knowledge.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, 6,200 yen per desk is steep. I need a layout that minimizes that transition time.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the quote is fixed. We cannot avoid it, but we can avoid paying it repeatedly by choosing a stable layout.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"- **Mizuki**: @Toshio, agreed. Stability saves money. But we must also ensure the quiet side isn’t hoarded by one person.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, I found the physio note. My chair takes days to settle. I need a permanent spot, not a rotating one.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, a permanent spot helps your chair, but it kills the accidental learning the joiners relied on. We need a middle ground.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
