63,3,1,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, I need the window side for the quiet. But I accept a fixed seat if it guarantees that spot.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Shion"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Shion: @Mizuki, I need the window side for the quiet. But I accept a fixed seat if it guarantees that spot.""}]}"
